<p>Wrap a psionic energy field around your weapons, increasing their armour penentration by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 5, 6, 7, 9</acronym> and allowing you to siphon excess energy from each weapon hit you land, gaining <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1.0, 1.7, 2.2, 2.6, 3.0</acronym> psi per hit.</p>